  "story": "Atlanta has lost the Internet. N2CALL-5 (the county EOC, cut off) calls N1CALL-10 in Austin in N1CALL-10's window, at :15 past the hour, as a client calls a gateway (role 1). It offers the message Shelter 3 left with it and sends two PROOF PDUs: Shelter 3's session record and Facundo's, a pickup only. N1CALL-10 sends the forward item it holds for N2CALL-5, Ana's message to Shelter 3, with radiopost.org's placement. N1CALL-10 receipts the message and both records; N2CALL-5 hangs up after transmission 4.",
  "rule": "As in session-01.json. The partner checks each PROOF as RP-7 §3.3 says (with `caller` N2CALL-5) before taking the messages it covers, and lists the record IDs it took in RECEIPT key 4. The caller checks each MSG key 6 placement (RP-7 §4.3) before holding the message as a copy for the address the placement names.",
